    "Opening hours - Ostfalia University of Applied Sciences\nSkip to main content\nOpening hours\nThe libraries at the Ostfalia locations are open longer during the lecture period and shorter during the lecture-free periods. Please note the\ninformation on our closing times.\nWolfenbüttel\nWolfsburg\nSalzgitter\nSuderburg\nOpening hours with limited services\nLecture-free periods / closing times 2026\nWolfenbüttel\nCurrent notes\nThrough Friday, September 18, 2026, the library will operate on the reduced hours in effect during the break between semesters.\nStarting Monday, September 21, 2026, the library will resume its regular semester hours.\nSemester opening hours\nMonday 10.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nTuesday 10.00 a.m.\n- 8.00 p.m. (Attention: 6.00 p.m. - 8.00 p.m.\nlimited services\n)\nWednesday 10.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\n(Attention: 4.00 p.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nlimited services\n)\nThursday 10.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m. (Attention: 4.00 p.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nlimited services\n)\nFriday 10.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nOpening hours during the\nlecture-free period\nMonday 10.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nTuesday 10.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nWednesday 10.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nThursday 10.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nFriday 10.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nWolfsburg\nCurrent notes\nThrough Friday, September 18, 2026, the library will operate on the reduced hours in effect during the break between semesters.\nStarting Monday, September 21, 2026, the library will resume its regular semester hours.\nDue to a staff shortage, the library in Wolfsburg will open as follows until further notice:\nSemester opening hours\nMonday 9.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nWednesday\n11.00\na.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.00 a.m. -\n3.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nOpening hours during the\nlecture-free period\nMonday 9.00 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nWednesday 9.00 a.m. - 3.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.00 a.m. - 12.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.00 a.m. - 12.00 p.m.\nSalzgitter\nCurrent notes\nThrough Friday, September 18, 2026, the library will operate on the reduced hours in effect during the break between semesters.\nStarting Monday, September 21, 2026, the library will resume its regular semester hours.\nSemester opening hours\nMonday 9.30 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.30 a.m. - 6.00 p.m.\nWednesday 9.30 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.30 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.30 a.m. - 2.00 p.m.\nOpening hours during the\nlecture-free period\nMonday 9.30 a.m. - 2.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.30 a.m - 5.00 p.m.\nWednesday 9.30 a.m - 2.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.30 a.m - 2.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.30 a.m - 12.00 p.m.\nSuderburg\nCurrent notes\nThrough Friday, September 18, 2026, the library will operate on the reduced hours in effect during the break between semesters.\nStarting Monday, September 21, 2026, the library will resume its regular semester hours.\nSemester opening hours\nMonday 9.00 a.m. - 5.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.00 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nWednesday 9.00 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.00 a.m. - 4.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nOpening hours during the\nlecture-free period\nMonday 9.00 a.m. -1.00 p.m.\nTuesday 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nWednesday 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nThursday 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nFriday 9.00 a.m. - 1.00 p.m.\nOpening hours with limited services\nPossible:\nWorking on site\nScanning and copying using the Ostfalia Card\nBorrowing from the open stacks at the self-service desk and counter\nReturning books (unfortunately it is not possible to immediately borrow books that have been returned)\nCollection of books ordered from other Ostfalia HaW locations (no interlibrary loan requests from other libraries that do not belong to Ostfalia!)\nRestrictions:\nOnly if your user account has no overdue fines and your Ostfalia card/library card is valid and already activated.\nIf you have to pay fees or if there are problems with your Ostfalia Card, these actions are not possible.\nExternal users will not be able to log in or carry out research on the local computers during this time.\nLecture-free periods / closing times 2026\n02.02. to 27.02.\n(lecture-free period) - shortened opening hours\n02.04\n. (Maundy Thursday) - shortened opening hours\n03.04.\n(Good Friday) - library closed\n06.04.\n(Easter Monday) - library closed\n07.04.\n(lecture-free) - shortened opening hours\n01.05.\n(Labour Day) - Library closed\n14.05.\n(Ascension Day) - library closed\n25.05. to 26.05.\n(Whitsun break) - library closed\n13.07. to 18.09.\n(lecture-free period) - shortened opening hours\n24.12.2026 to 01.01.2027\n(Christmas break) - library closed\nCookie Notice\nIn order for our website to function technically, we use necessary cookies. In addition, optional cookies enable the best possible use of the site. By ticking the box you give your consent. You can revoke your consent at any time. More information in our\nprivacy policy\n.\nMandatory\nAccept mandatory cookies\nAnalysis (Matomo)\nAccept analysis cookies\nThird-party providers\n: Accept third-party provider cookies\nConfirm selection\nAccept all"
